---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber off
    actor Admin
    actor Steward
    participant Page as Site page<br/>app/detail/[namesite]
    participant Server as Server actions<br/>SiteSafetyPriorityActions (proposed)
    participant DB as Supabase DB<br/>W26_site_priority (proposed)

    Note over Admin,DB: Covers US 2.0.12 and 2.0.13. No priority scores exist in the code today.<br/>"(proposed)" = the step is not in the code today.

    Note over Admin,DB: Save the three scores (US 2.0.12 AT 1, AT 5, US 2.0.13 AT 3)
    Admin->>Page: Enter points for abuses, biological imperatives<br/>and time since the last visit, then Save
    Page->>Server: updateSitePriorityScores(siteId, scores) (proposed)
    Server->>Server: Check caller is Admin from a trusted role source
    alt Caller is not Admin (US 2.0.12 AT 5)
        Server-->>Page: Refused. Scores stay the same
    else Caller is Admin
        Server->>DB: Upsert W26_site_priority row.<br/>Set points_saved_at to now and saved_by to the caller
        Server-->>Page: Saved. The reminder is absent (US 2.0.13 AT 3)
    end

    Note over Admin,DB: Show the priority (US 2.0.12 AT 2, AT 3, AT 4, US 2.0.13 AT 1, AT 2, AT 4)
    Steward->>Page: Open a Site page
    Page->>Server: getSitePriority(siteId) (proposed)
    Server->>DB: Read the W26_site_priority row
    DB-->>Server: Three scores and points_saved_at
    Server->>Server: computeVisitPriority(scores). Same scores give the same priority
    opt Caller is Admin and points_saved_at is more than one year ago
        Server->>Server: Add needsReassessment = true (US 2.0.13)
    end
    Server-->>Page: Priority and three scores. needsReassessment only for Admins
    Page-->>Steward: Show priority and three scores. No reminder (US 2.0.13 AT 4)

    Note over Admin,DB: The server calculates the priority and the reminder, so each client shows the same values.<br/>Open questions: the formula of computeVisitPriority, and if "time since the last visit"<br/>is typed by an Admin or calculated from the newest W26_form_responses.inspection_date.
